description:
This App provides iPhone users with a seamless solution to record and store phone conversations, allowing individuals to capture important discussions for future reference. The app offers features like unlimited call recordings, a user-friendly interface, and secure storage options, ensuring ease of access and privacy. Its subscription-based model provides flexibility for users to choose plans that suit their usage needs, making it suitable for both personal and professional use.

Key Values:
1. Memory & Accuracy;
2. Productivity & Time-Saving;
3. Peace of Mind;
4. Professional & Legal Backup.

Competitive Differentiators:
- Instant start / one-tap recording;
- Crystal-clear audio;
- Organized library;
- Secure storage; 
- Easy sharing.

Key Highlights
✅ Profitable iOS call recording app with $1.3M TTM revenue and $200K net profit
✅ Unlimited call recordings, crystal-clear audio, and secure storage for personal or professional use
✅ One-tap instant start, organized library, and easy sharing for maximum convenience
✅ Subscription-based model with ~35% net margin and strong ARR of $1.4M
✅ High growth potential in both scale and profitability; 50% YoY revenue growth
✅ Low-maintenance, stable product ideal for long-term passive income or strategic expansion
